{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15447","headline":"送濮阳录事赴忠州 · 李端","name":"送濮阳录事赴忠州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"成名不遂双旌远，主印还爲一郡雄。\n赤叶黄花随野岸，青山白水映江枫。\n巴人夜语孤舟里，越鸟春啼万壑中。\n闻说古书多未校，肯令才子久西东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15447.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15447","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}